  "description": "Effects — shared shadow + blur scales\n\nShadows override Tailwind's defaults so values match Figma tokens\n\nUsage: shadow-md → var(--shadow-md) → var(--effect-shadow-md)\n\nShadow utilities read effect aliases at runtime so generated themes can swap\n visual depth without rebuilding Tailwind classes.",
